---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { site, topicPages } from '../data/site';
---
<footer class="bg-forest-950 pb-24 pt-16 text-white md:pb-12">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.4fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-white/[.10] ring-1 ring-white/[.15]">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" class="size-8" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M24 39S8.5 30 8.5 18.8c0-6.2 7.3-9.4 11.8-3.7 1.5 1.9 2.6 4.1 3.7 6.3 1.1-2.2 2.2-4.4 3.7-6.3 4.5-5.7 11.8-2.5 11.8 3.7C39.5 30 24 39 24 39Z" fill="#f7f4ec"/>
            <path d="M24 33V21m0 4-5-4m5 7 6-4.5" fill="none" stroke="#b85f42" stroke-width="2.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-lg font-black">大溪河濱公園旅遊指南</p>
          <p class="text-xs tracking-wider text-white/[.45]">{site.domain}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-white/[.62]">
        本站為獨立旅遊資訊網站，與桃園市政府及公園管理單位無隸屬或代理關係。開放狀況、設施維護、活動與交通資訊可能臨時變動，請以官方及現場公告為準。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href={site.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="pin" size={16} /> Google Maps 導航
        </a>
        <a href="/#sources" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/[.20] bg-white/[.05] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white/[.85] transition hover:bg-white/[.10]">
          資料來源與授權
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-black tracking-wider text-white">主題專區</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-white/[.60]">
          <li>
            <a class="group block hover:text-white" href="/">
              <span class="font-bold text-white/[.85]">大溪河濱公園總覽</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-6 text-white/[.45]">園區地圖、親子玩法與順遊行程</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          {topicPages.map((page) => (
            <li>
              <a class="group block hover:text-white" href={page.path}>
                <span class="font-bold text-white/[.85]">{page.heading}</span>
                <span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-6 text-white/[.45]">{page.summary}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-black tracking-wider text-white">本站導覽</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/[.60]">
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#weather">即時天氣</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#highlights">景點亮點</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#park-map">園區示意圖</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#transport">交通與停車</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#facilities">園區設施</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#faq">常見問題</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#google-rating">Google 評分</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href="/#sources">資料來源</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-sm font-black tracking-wider text-white">資料與照片</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-white/[.60]">
          <li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href={site.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">樂桃園 P@rk Go <Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></li>
          <li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href={site.tourismUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">桃園觀光導覽網 <Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></li>
          <li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://publicart.tyccc.gov.tw/open/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">政府網站資料開放宣告 <Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></li>
          <li><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href={site.reviewsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google 地圖評論頁 <Icon name="external" size={13} /></a></li>
          <li>照片：桃園市政府工務局</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-white/[.10] bg-white/[.04] p-5">
    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-black tracking-wider text-white/[.55]">
      <Icon name="camera" size={16} /> 圖片版權
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-white/[.65]">
      {site.imageCopyright}
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-white/[.45]">
      本站評分與評論數同步自 Google 地圖使用者評論（{site.ratingSyncedAt}）；個別評論為原作者與 Google 地圖所有，僅作參考引用。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page mt-12 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-white/[.10] pt-6 text-xs text-white/[.40] sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {site.domain}. 獨立旅遊指南</p>
    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <span>資料最後更新：{site.updatedAt}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>評分同步時間：{site.ratingSyncedAt}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-forest-800/[.10] bg-white/[.92] p-2 shadow-[0_-12px_35px_rgba(24,49,40,.12)] backdrop-blur-xl md:hidden">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-md grid-cols-3 gap-2">
    <a href="/#park-map" class="flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-black text-forest-800"><Icon name="map" size={19} />園區地圖</a>
    <a href="/parking" class="flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl text-[11px] font-black text-forest-800"><Icon name="parking" size={19} />停車交通</a>
    <a href={site.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex min-h-12 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-xl bg-forest-800 text-[11px] font-black text-white"><Icon name="pin" size={19} />開始導航</a>
  </div>
</div>

